--- LƯỢT 1 ---
Spec Valid: True | Verified: False
Error Taxonomy: OutOfBounds
Error Message: [OutOfBounds] tại Dòng 9, Cột 63: index out of range
Code:
method below_threshold(l : seq<int>, t : int) returns (b : bool)
    // post-conditions-start
    ensures b == (forall i : int :: i >= 0 && i < |l| ==> l[i] < t)
    // post-conditions-end
{
    b := true;
    var i := 0;
    while i < |l|
        invariant b == (forall j : int :: j >= 0 && j < i ==> l[j] < t)
        decreases |l| - i
    {
        if l[i] >= t {
            b := false;
            break;
        }
        i := i + 1;
    }
}

